---
const {editPath,repoUrl='https://github.com/yen-chiu/yen-chiu.github.io',class:className}=Astro.props
const email='yenchiu.he@gmail.com'
---
<section class:list={['help-support',className]} aria-label='文档反馈与维护'>
 <h2>一起完善这份文档</h2><p>有疑问或发现错误，欢迎联系 Wendell，也可以直接提交修改。</p>
 <div class='help-actions'><a href={`mailto:${email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('博客文档反馈')}`}>邮件反馈 ↗</a>{editPath&&<a href={editPath} target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>编辑此页 ↗</a>}<a href={`${repoUrl}/issues`} target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>报告问题 ↗</a><a href='https://yenchiu.com/folio/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>完整文档库 ↗</a></div>
 <small>{email}</small>
</section>
<style>.help-support{padding:1.1rem;border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:.9rem;background:hsl(var(--muted)/.2);}h2{font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;margin:0;}p{font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.8;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));margin:.5rem 0 .8rem;}.help-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;}.help-actions a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:.4rem .7rem;border:1px solid hsl(var(--border));border-radius:.5rem;font-size:.78rem;color:hsl(var(--primary));}small{display:block;margin-top:.7rem;font-size:.72rem;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground));overflow-wrap:anywhere;}</style>
